      "created_at": "2013-05-06T01:26:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If a card prevents Hero Cards from being played, can Omnitron-X still play them via his innat power? Obviously Environemnt and Villain Decks are generally still playable as most \"cannot play\" cards specify hero cards, but what about playing from a hero deck? Is this still forbidden, only allowing him to discard it? Or is this permissable since it's not being played from the hand?</p>",
